  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Innovation and scaling agriculture through Trellis Initiative working in partnership with Acumen</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To innovate and scale agriculture via Trellis initiative.  Trellis is Acumen&apos;s pioneer agriculture initiative - a five-year, $30m (approx. &#xa3;25m) initiative that will make up to 25-30 investments in early-stage agri-business entrepreneurs across four investment regions in Latin America, west Africa, East Africa, and India from 2022-2027, impacting 2 million farmers.  Trellis focusses on provided high risk, early-stage patient capital for pioneering agri-enterprises with a focus on building climate resilience and delivering high-impact solutions to increase productivity and access to markets for small holder farmers globally.</narrative>
  </description>
